    <briefdescription>
<para>Standardized recovery fault handling and edge case resolution. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header provides mechanisms for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Detecting and classifying recovery faults (torn WAL, timeout, checkpoint invalid)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Implementing standardized fail-safe behavior for each fault class</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Emitting structured diagnostic events for operator awareness</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Suggesting and executing recovery actions</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Phase 3 Objective: Unify error handling for recovery-phase faults across the storage module persistence and replay layers.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="storage__api__contract_8h" kindref="compound">include/storage/storage_api_contract.h</ref> — Recovery contract §3 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="storage__error__diagnostics_8h" kindref="compound">include/storage/storage_error_diagnostics.h</ref> — Error classification </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>src/storage/ROADMAP.md — Phase 3 items </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
